SUMMARY:A Symphonic Tribute to Frank Sinatra: Come Fly with Me\, Ol' Blue E
 yes
LOCATION:National Naval Aviation Museum (Blue Angels Atrium)\, 1750 Radford
  Blvd\, Pensacola\, FL 32508
DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/23 · 7:00 PM\n\nBrian Duprey and his 13-piece orches
 tra perform a symphonic tribute to Frank Sinatra in the Blue Angels Atrium
  at the National Naval Aviation Museum. It's Friday\, October 23 at 7 PM. 
 The evening runs through Sinatra's catalog with a full orchestra behind th
 e vocals. Because the museum sits on NAS Pensacola\, anyone 18 or older wi
 thout a DOD ID card must file a base-access form with Riley Stephens. It's
  due October 9 to get on base for the show.\n\nPrice: No published price\n
 \nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-a-symphonic-tribute-to-f
 rank-sinatra-come-fl-1023.html
